OL,10,     Fcouple's feelings: will it cost
OL,11,     Fthem the competition?
OL,12,G1100 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time. Amid
OL,16,     Faccusations and flaring tempers,
OL,17,     Fthe payments are revealed and the
OL,18,     Fwinner is announced.
