OL,5,G1825 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition heads north to the
OL,7,     Fthree-star Vidella in Blackpool,
OL,8,     Frun by fun-loving pranksters John
OL,9,     Fand Neil, who have hatched a plan
OL,10,     Fto pay back Alistair for hating
OL,11,     Ftheir home town.
OL,12,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe group check in to the boutique
OL,14,     FUrban Beach B&B in Bournemouth,
OL,15,     Fwith its mod cons and deluxe
OL,16,     Fbathrooms. And host Mark treats
OL,17,     Fhis guests to a speedboat ride
OL,18,     Falong the Jurassic Coast.
